{{See also|List of United States senators from Massachusetts}}
Two-term Democrat [[Ed Markey]] was [[2020 United States Senate election in Massachusetts|reelected in 2020]] with 66.2% of the vote and is seeking a third full term.<ref name="Markey">{{cite web |url=https://www.wcvb.com/article/sen-markey-massachusetts-third-term/62720311 |title=Sen. Ed Markey, 78, says he'll seek third term in 2 years |publisher=[[WCVB-TV]] |date=October 25, 2024}}</ref> The longest-serving Democrat in [[United States Congress|Congress]], Markey will be 80 on [[Election day|Election Day]] and has faced calls to retire. This also happened during the [[2020 United States Senate election in Massachusetts|2020 Democratic primary]].<ref>{{Cite web |last=Cristantiello |first=Ross |title=Markey says he'll run again in 2026, at age 80 |url=https://www.boston.com/news/politics/2024/10/28/markey-says-hell-run-again-in-2026-at-age-80/ |access-date=November 26, 2024 |website=The Boston Globe |date=October 28, 2024}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web |year=2024 |title=Ed Markey defends choice to run for third term at age 80 as debate over senator age limits simmers |url=https://www.bostonglobe.com/2024/10/30/metro/ed-markey-reelection-senate-2026/ |access-date=November 26, 2024 |website=The Boston Globe}}</ref> Markey defeated [[U.S. Representative]] [[Seth Moulton]] in the September 1 Democratic primary.<ref name="Moulton">{{cite news |title=Congressman Seth Moulton announces run for U.S. Senate |url=https://www.wbur.org/news/2025/10/15/seth-moulton-us-senate-ed-markey-massachusetts-candidate |access-date=October 15, 2025 |publisher=[[WBUR]] |date=October 15, 2025}}</ref>

Attorney John Deaton, who was the Republican nominee against U.S. Senator [[Elizabeth Warren]] in [[2024 United States Senate election in Massachusetts|2024]], is again the Republican nominee.<ref name="Deaton">{{cite news |last1=Klein |first1=Asher |title=Republican John Deaton announces second straight U.S. Senate run |url=https://www.nbcboston.com/news/local/john-deaton-2026-senate-campaign-mass/3843142/ |access-date=November 11, 2025 |publisher=[[NBC10 Boston]] |date=November 10, 2025}}</ref>
